# Cloudflare Pages redirects — https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# Referral bounce: buildReferralLink() (src/utils/deepLinking.ts) emits
# https://wordfallgame.app/r/{code}. Devices with the app installed never
# reach this file — Android App Links (assetlinks.json) route straight into
# the app. Everyone else lands here and bounces to the Play listing with the
# referral code preserved in the install-referrer param, so attribution
# survives the store hop.
/r/* https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.wordfall.game&referrer=wordfall_ref_:splat 302
